---
layout: layouts/base.njk
pageTitle: "Digital Nomad Visas 2026 | Tax Rates & Requirements"
pageDescription: "Compare 2026 digital nomad visas from around the world. Find minimum income requirements, tax rates, and application processing times for top remote work destinations."
permalink: /visas/
---

{% include "partials/breadcrumbs.njk" %}

<div class="section-container mt-16 text-center">
    <div class="badge-2026 mb-4" style="display: inline-block;">
        <span class="badge-dot"></span> Verified 2026 Data
    </div>
    <h1 class="aura-title large-title" style="font-size: 3.5rem;">Digital Nomad Visas</h1>
    <p class="text-dim subtitle-text max-w-2xl mx-auto mt-4">
        Navigate the legal and tax landscape for remote work. Compare nomad visa programs by minimum income, tax benefits, and duration to optimize your global residency.
    </p>
</div>

<div class="section-container mt-16 mb-24">
    <div class="partner-grid" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(350px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem;">
        {% for country in countries | sort(attribute="name") %}
        <a href="/visas/{{ country.slug }}/" class="glass-panel aura-hover-glow" style="padding: 1.5rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 16px;">
            <div style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
                <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 0 0 0.25rem 0; color: white;">{{ country.name }}</h2>
                <p style="color: var(--aura-primary); margin: 0; font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 500;">{{ country.visaName }}</p>
            </div>
            
            <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
                <div style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); padding: 0.75rem; border-radius: 8px; text-align: center;">
                    <div style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-dim); margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">Nomad Tax Rate</div>
                    <div style="color: white; font-weight: bold; font-size: 1.1rem;">{{ country.tax | percentInt }}</div>
                </div>
                <div style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); padding: 0.75rem; border-radius: 8px; text-align: center;">
                    <div style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-dim); margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">Min. Income</div>
                    <div style="color: white; font-weight: bold; font-size: 1.1rem;">${{ country.minIncomeMonthly | localeString }}/mo</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div style="margin-top: auto; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
                <div style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-dim);">
                    Region: <span style="color: white;">{{ country.continent }}</span>
                </div>
                <span style="color: var(--aura-primary); font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: bold;">View Visa Guide →</span>
            </div>
        </a>
        {% endfor %}
    </div>
</div>

<div class="section-container mt-16 mb-16">
    {% include "partials/seo-silos.njk" %}
</div>
